I arrive at the apartment.
It is still raining heavily outside.
I quickly step into the lobby.
There is no rain there.
My neighbor Anitha is standing there.
Anitha looks at me and smiles.
"Maya, it is raining heavily," Anitha says.
I fold my wet umbrella.
"Yes, this is my first rain in Kochi," I say.
"It is very hot in the city now," Anitha says.
"This rain is a big relief."
"It is very sunny during the day," I say.
"So this rain is good."
"Will it rain tomorrow too?" I ask.
"Yes, it will rain tomorrow too," Anitha says.
"Now the heat in the city will decrease."
A nice cool breeze comes into the lobby.
We enjoy the rain and breeze for a short time.
